  "max_tokens": 2000,
  "messages": [{
    "role": "user",
    "content": "Write a professional monthly performance report for {{ $json.clientName }} ({{ $json.brand }}).

Data for {{ $json.month }}:
- Ad spend: ${{ $json.metrics.spend }}
- True leads: {{ $json.metrics.trueLeads }}
- True CPL: ${{ $json.metrics.trueCpl }}
