- Appointments: {{ $json.pipeline.appointments }}
- Applications: {{ $json.pipeline.applications }}
- CPM: ${{ $json.metrics.cpm }}
- Frequency: {{ $json.metrics.frequency }}
- Double-counting detected: {{ $json.metrics.doubleCount }}

Write 5 sections with clear headers:
1. "What Worked This Month" — 3-4 bullet points
2. "What Changed" — what was adjusted and why
3. "Actions Taken" — specific optimizations made
4. "Next 30 Days" — planned actions
5. "Summary" — 2-3 sentence executive summary

Tone: professional, direct, data-driven. Written to the business owner, not to a marketing expert. Avoid jargon.

Respond with JSON only:
{
  "whatWorked": "section content",
  "whatChanged": "section content",
  "actionsTaken": "section content",
  "next30Days": "section content",
  "summary": "section content"
}"
  }]
}

